B.a8A=new A.Eq("Imprint",B.aYz)
B.bd9=new A.ad("1. Controller","The Salvation Army in Germany ([address see imprint]). Data protection officer: [contact].")
B.bcn=new A.ad("2. Server access data",'When the app is opened, the web server logs technical data: IP address, date and time, requested file, browser details, to run the service securely (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). Logs are deleted after [7] days. Parameters in links sit behind the "#" and never reach the server.')
B.bda=new A.ad("3. Your entries stay on your device",'Notes, values, gifts, prayer impressions, goals, photos and all other entries are stored only in the local storage of your browser or device. They are not transmitted to the Salvation Army or third parties. This storage is strictly necessary for the requested function (section 25(2) no. 2 TDDDG); no cookies for advertising or analytics are set. Storage is not encrypted. You can remove everything at any time via "Backup \u2192 Delete all data".')
B.bcC=new A.ad("4. No third parties","The app loads no fonts, scripts or code from third parties (e.g. Google). Everything comes from our own server.")
B.bcT=new A.ad("5. Gift reference",'If you ask someone to assess you in the gifts test, the app creates a link. The reviewer can send back their name (optional) and answers through it. These sit behind the "#" and are not sent to the web server. They reach the inviting person only via the channel you choose (e.g. a messenger), whose own privacy rules apply.')
B.bdg=new A.ad("6. Bible references",u.M)
B.bcS=new A.ad("7. Backup, sharing and PDF","Backup files and exported PDFs contain your entries unencrypted. You decide where you pass them on. Keep them safe.")
B.bdl=new A.ad("8. Leader mode","Leader mode unlocks additional notes for group leaders. It processes no personal data of participants.")
B.bcs=new A.ad("9. Your rights","You have the right of access, rectification, erasure, restriction and objection where data about you is stored on the server (see section 2), and may complain to a data protection authority: [competent authority].")
B.aXU=s([B.bd9,B.bcn,B.bda,B.bcC,B.bcT,B.bdg,B.bcS,B.bdl,B.bcs],t.Wy)
B.a8C=new A.Eq("Privacy policy",B.aXU)
B.arC=s(["Everything you enter stays on this device only \u2013 there is no user account and no server that receives your content.",'Entries are not encrypted. On a shared device, please delete all data under "Backup" after use.',"The app has no advertising and no tracking and loads nothing from third parties such as Google.","As usual, the web server stores technical access data (e.g. IP address)."],t.s)
