B.bdm=new A.ad("Your entries stay on your device",'Everything you enter (notes, values, gifts, prayer impressions, goals \u2026) is stored only in your browser or device \u2013 not on a server. The Salvation Army does not receive this content. Storage is not encrypted, so on shared devices please delete all data after use (see "Backup").')
B.bcx=new A.ad("What the server logs","Like any website, the web server records technical access data when the app is opened (e.g. IP address, time, requested file). The app does not load fonts, scripts or code from third parties such as Google.")
B.bcH=new A.ad("Gift reference",'If you ask someone to assess you in the gifts test, the return link contains the reviewer\'s name and answers. These sit behind the "#" of the link and are therefore not sent to the web server. They only reach the person you send the link to \u2013 and the messenger you use.')
B.bd1=new A.ad("Bible references",u.M)
